{"study_accession":"PRJNA1059145","secondary_study_accession":"SRP480738","title":"RNA sequencing of CTOT19 transplantation patients [bulk RNA-seq]","description":"The CTOT19 cohort (38.2% AA, 44% White) represents a randomized controlled trial investigating the efficacy of remicade induction therapy for deceased donor kidney transplant recipients within 2 year followed-up (NCT02495077). With a cohort of 225 patients, the study spanned 2 years to assess the effectiveness of this therapy. Overall design: RNA sequencing was executed on pretransplant blood from 130 recipients, utilizing 75bp-long paired-end (75PE) reads. Notably, the recipients were representative of various ethnicities: 49 African American, 26 Caucasian, 41 Hispanic, and 14 individuals from other ethnic backgrounds. RNA sequencing data in this cohort was used to validate the variant expression of LILRB3-4SNPs in AA recipients. The RNA data in 49 AA recipients was combined with two cohorts to identify the meta-gene signatures associated with the LILRB3-4SNPs.","pubmed":"40065170","geo_series":"","n_samples":23,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN39198747","study_accession":"PRJNA1059145","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"VR-0776","description":"VR-0776","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7998437","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2024-12-29","attributes":[["source_name","Whole blood"],["tissue","Whole blood"],["ethnicity","Hispanic or Latino"],["race","Latin American"],["treatment","Pre-transplant"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR27385012","experiment_accession":"SRX23061289","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 2000","read_count":17289825,"base_count":3318707597,"first_public":"2024-12-29","experiment_title":"NextSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM7998437: VR-0776 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN39198763","study_accession":"PRJNA